  theta=0.0275: 0.00447 +/- 0.00008, mean reversals=8.96,  mean wait=10.69s
  theta=0.0300: 0.00421 +/- 0.00008, mean reversals=7.55,  mean wait=12.50s
Empirical grid-argmax peak: theta=0.02 (tied with 0.0175 to 3 sig figs).
Plot: paper/notes/ou_mc_sweep.png.

